            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "statement": "Argo CD 3.0.0 adds a default configuration for resource.customizations.ignoreResourceUpdates in the argocd-cm ConfigMap that excludes common mutated resources and always ignores .status changes; the v2 behavior can be preserved by overriding or removing this configuration."
